# Explicit exclusions for local dev: `mint dev` can otherwise try to parse
# Markdown under pnpm’s nested store (e.g. node_modules/.pnpm/.../CHANGELOG.md) as MDX.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
**/.pnpm/**
**/.cursor/**
**/.claude/**
**/.github/**
**/.agents/**
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/CHANGES.md
**/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
**/SECURITY.md

# Agent config (atlas ADR-0008), not docs pages: Mint fails to parse AGENTS.md's HTML comments as
# MDX and resolves relative links in agent files as site routes.
/AGENTS.md
/agents/
/docs/agents/

# Runnable sample apps, not docs content (its README is for GitHub, not the site).
# Root-anchored: a bare `examples/` would also hide developers/viewer/examples/.
/examples/
